# ARMSX1 Discord application credentials.
#
# NOT source-controlled — see .gitignore. Mirrors ARMSX2's arrangement: the build reads
# APPLICATION_ID here and derives the OAuth callback scheme as "discord-<APPLICATION_ID>"
# unless APPLICATION_SCHEME overrides it. That derived scheme is what must be registered as
# a redirect URI in the Discord developer portal.
